# cleanbeansllc.com document root
# Until launch, visitors to the home page see the under-construction page at /uc/.
# The website itself is staged at /w/ (reachable by direct link for testing and review).
# 302 (temporary) on purpose: at launch this becomes a redirect to /w/, and a 301 would be cached by browsers.
# Only the home page is redirected; /.well-known/ (SSL renewals), /uc/ and /w/ are untouched.
Options -Indexes
RedirectMatch 302 ^/(index\.html?)?$ /uc/
